- **File List Improvement**: Ensure all UI pages are thoroughly tested and monitored for expected content. If any components are added or modified, update the file list accordingly to include new templates or utility files.

By addressing these points, the RecipeHub project can improve both functionality and user experience while maintaining simplicity appropriate for a small-scale project.

